_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.4.beta [a013481b0911e59cc3f3dea7ebb732450c3e1460]\n- Not reproducible in: 4.4.beta1 [d33da79d3f8fe84be2521d25b9ba8e440cf25a88]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta (a013481b0) - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - integrated AMD Radeon(TM) Graphics (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.11029.1008) - AMD Ryzen 9 7940HS w/ Radeon 780M Graphics (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe `CanvasItem` property `clip_children`, which is meant to allow the parent to act as a mask for any of its `CanvasItem` children, seemingly has no effect in current `master` (a013481b0911e59cc3f3dea7ebb732450c3e1460).\n\nHere's what it looked like in 4.4-beta1:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c0156e4c-641d-4153-82d8-e9b3d70a215a)\n\nHere's what it looks like now:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fc242ecb-21ee-45fd-ad08-f60051753fb9)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open the MRP in latest `master`.\n- Observe the issue.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[clip-children-bug-4.4.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18585252/clip-children-bug-4.4.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/eve